>2) What does a bag of holding do exactly?

Items inside are reduced to one quarter their normal weight (Blessed)
Items inside are reduced to half their normal weight (Uncursed)
Items inside are increased to double their normal weight (Cursed)

Additionally, if a BoH is cursed, then attempting to remove anything from
the bag will result in 1/13th of the items inside being destroyed forever.

Placing a charged Wand of Cancellation or Bag of Tricks or another Bag of
Holding inside a Bag of Holding will result in an explosion which destroys
all of the items involved, including everything inside the Bag(s) of
Holding, and will do damage to you in the process.

Bags of Holding, like all other containers, can store an infinite number of
items (or is it limited to 32,000 items? That's not a limit that you'll
realistically run into, so still effectively infinite).



